# Keeps the build context small and stops host state leaking into the image.
# Anything the build genuinely needs is COPYed explicitly in apps/api/Dockerfile.

# Installed inside the image by `npm ci`. Copying the host's would break native modules built
# for a different platform, and is the single biggest cause of slow Docker builds here.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Built inside the image.
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets and local state must never reach an image layer — layers are readable by anyone who
# can pull it, and deleting a file in a later layer does not remove it from the earlier one.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Not needed at runtime.
coverage
**/coverage
docs
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.claude
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
README.md
**/*.md
!apps/api/fixtures/README.md

# Docker's own files.
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml

.DS_Store
*.log
